amined, clues gathered, trails followed and suspects questioned until the truth emerges. The Victorian city is presented with an eye to period accuracy, and the plot takes several unexpected turns.\n\nThe story leans into a darker side of the detective. The game is single-player and relies on observation and deduction rather than combat, so it suits mystery fans, and readers of the Holmes stories who want a case that puts the great detective under real pressure."}}